From dafbf7f83d81cea79804ec731a6214a47e53d646 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MT6762 local experiment <mt6762-build@localhost>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 23:40:47 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm: add opt-in inherited display and PWM laboratory fixtures

AI-assisted local experiment, not intended for upstream submission. Adds explicit synthetic register readbacks, bounded framebuffer assertions, PWM commit and fault fixtures, and independent QTest checks. No physical display or scanout emulation is claimed.
